do_1 = "Decision 2490 (triage record spec/layerx-merge/programme/issues/1578.kvx, verdict task): the MCP proof target (layerx-mcp/tests/proof_native_reads.rs:23-25) includes the agentd harness (layerx-agentd/tests/proof_native_reads.rs:11-13), which includes proof_serve_errors.rs; its proof module (lines 543-900) registers seven tests and five of them call Service::start, which reads LOCAL_NODE_RPC (lines 642 and 708), so the unfiltered MCP target fails without an externally configured node. Separate the live-node tests from the shared harness source (move the proof module's tests into their own agentd test target that the harness does not include, or guard them with a cfg the consumer target does not set) so the unfiltered MCP target runs to completion with only the disposable node the proof starts."
do_2 = "Keep the native-read proof's producer, transport and consumer coverage unchanged and keep the daemon HTTP proof tests runnable under their own agentd target with LOCAL_NODE_RPC; the verify runs the unfiltered MCP target with LOCAL_NODE_RPC unset."
